sequenceDiagram
    participant API
    participant Inventory
    participant Billing
    participant Orders
    par Reserve stock
        API-)Inventory: Reserve the items
        Inventory-->>API: Reservation confirmed
    and Authorize payment
        API-)Billing: Authorize the total
        Billing-->>API: Authorization confirmed
    end
    critical Commit the order
        API->>Orders: Record both confirmations
        Orders-->>API: Order number
    option Reservation expires
        API->>Inventory: Release reserved stock
        API->>Billing: Void the authorization
    end
